      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MADAM SERIOUS (2) hit the ground running and was prominent to the turn but faded out of it when 6th at Ballarat in Grade 5 company. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. WESTSIDE WIZARD (8) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (23.01) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record here winning three races. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. ZIPPING CHOI (4) scored two back when on speed but last start drifted back and could manage only a 4 length 5th at Healesville (19.55). The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Deserves plenty of respect. WHIZZ MAXIMUS (5) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
